# Polish "this" demonstrative, the full pronominal paradigm.  "w tym tygodniu"
# is the instrumental/locative "tym", "tego roku" the genitive.  The dative
# "temu" is deliberately withheld: in Polish "temu" is the ago-marker ("dwa dni
# temu"), so admitting it here would read a past offset as a present one.
# Regular pronoun declension per the PWN inflection rules.
# https://sjp.pwn.pl/zasady/
ten
tego
tym
ta
tej
tę
tą
to
te
tych
tymi
